                <mxCell id="api_note" value="Single Cloud Run service, single port 8080. main.py serves dist/ as StaticFiles at /, mounts /api/* on the same FastAPI app. Cold-start budget dominated by Python import graph (lib/, gcp.database connector) — frontend assets are pre-built at image-build time. min-instances=1 + --no-cpu-throttling (PR #507) for BackgroundTasks." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=9;fontColor=#444444;fontStyle=2;" parent="1" vertex="1">
